</pre>


If you dig deeper it fails here:

![Screen Shot 2019-12-05 at 10 06 47](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/8074436/70221332-6e125200-1748-11ea-9c06-e77a4db2ff69.png)

and component code looks like this:

```js
